12 for product 1), and spare units carry over to later days. So ordering a bit above the forecast, about 1.1–1.2×, should pay best. Plan 7 at exactly the forecast will run short often. Plan 3 at 1.3× will waste stock that expires.\n- **Warehouse limit (208):** the 3-day plans, and plan 0 around days 9–10, get close to 208 units once leftovers pile up. When demand runs low, some deliveries will overflow and be lost.\n\n**Likely ranking:** the 2-day plans (0 and 6) and the daily plans with a moderate margin (4 and 5) look best. The 3-day plans are in the middle. Plan 7 (too little) and plan 3 (too much) look worst."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4308, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4308}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:40:30.107Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVSRXFCQynuhR76mcGXF"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_012ckuhc6SzwvqPr9yrXRcAt", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVSRXTcHmTBjp7ZWc8iN", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_012ckuhc6SzwvqPr9yrXRcAt", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.65, 0.45, 0.4, 0.3, 0.55, 0.6, 0.65, 0.35]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 