nits of product 0 are lost. Candidate 2 loses about 18 units of product 1 on day 9.\n- **Candidate 7 orders exactly the forecast, which is below average demand.** It runs short all the time, and each missing unit costs about 15 (the lost margin plus the penalty). It also pays the full 840 in fees, so it should be the worst.\n- **Daily ordering at 1.1 (candidate 4) costs 420–540 more in fees** than the batch plans. Even so, it should beat the batch plans at 1.2, which lose more to write-offs.\n\n**Ranking:** 2 ≈ 6 > 4 > 0 ≈ 1 > 5 > 3 ≈ 7."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4493, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4493}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:41:16.790Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVSUGCfXUuMmfuYQukVq"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01R6oXbiEnk81C5yyGD3DR5C", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVSUGVHKTTzBwvHudqf8", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01R6oXbiEnk81C5yyGD3DR5C", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.5, 0.45, 0.75, 0.2, 0.62, 0.35, 0.75, 0.25]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4493, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "ca